hen I'd like to see her degree."}, {"start": 559.98, "end": 562.62, "text": "He's budding antlers with you because you're a threat now."}, {"start": 562.62, "end": 563.86, "text": "You've got your own place."}, {"start": 563.86, "end": 565.26, "text": "You've got a future."}, {"start": 565.26, "end": 568.98, "text": "You've got a bowl full of olives next to the toilet."}, {"start": 568.98, "end": 570.94, "text": "It's a fancy party, Britta."}, {"start": 570.94, "end": 573.56, "text": "- You know what Jeff has in his bathroom?"}, {"start": 573.56, "end": 574.6, "text": "Neither do I."}, {"start": 574.6, "end": 578.52, "text": "He keeps his toiletries in a safe under the sink."}, {"start": 578.52, "end": 581.86, "text": "His whole personality is based around guarding himself."}, {"start": 581.86, "end": 584.0, "text": "You don't have to be like that to be a man."}, {"start": 586.64, "end": 588.04, "text": "- You're really cool, Berta."}, {"start": 589.18, "end": 592.14, "text": "- Man, pizza guys are getting worse and worse looking."}, {"start": 592.14, "end": 594.46, "text": "- Guess all the good ones went into porn."}, {"start": 594.46, "end": 595.74, "text": "- Ceiling fan."}, {"start": 595.74, "end": 596.9, "text": "- I miss all the fun."}, {"start": 596.9, "end": 598.58, "text": "- I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 598.58, "end": 599.78, "text": "- Who cares? - Who cares?"}, {"start": 600.94, "end": 603.52, "text": "[ Laughs ]"}, {"start": 603.52, "end": 605.58, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 605.58, "end": 606.62, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 606.62, "end": 609.62, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 609.62, "end": 611.32, "text": "-Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating"}, {"start": 611.32, "end": 614.52, "text": "six different timelines. -Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 614.52, "end": 618.16, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 618.16, "end": 621.24, "text": "-Six. One, two, th