 terror! Fear the terror, Troy!"}, {"start": 690.22, "end": 693.02, "text": "Fear the terror, Norwegian Troy!"}, {"start": 693.02, "end": 694.62, "text": "What's going on in here?"}, {"start": 694.62, "end": 697.02, "text": "Here's to terrorizing Troy because he's jealous we moved in together."}, {"start": 697.02, "end": 698.22, "text": "You're the one who's jealous!"}, {"start": 698.22, "end": 699.02, "text": "Why would I be jealous?"}, {"start": 699.02, "end": 701.22, "text": "Because you're lonely and crazy!"}, {"start": 707.02, "end": 710.32, "text": "Hey guys, this is Toby, our pizza delivery guy,"}, {"start": 710.32, "end": 712.22, "text": "and I know this is going to sound nuts,"}, {"start": 712.22, "end": 715.02, "text": "but we're in love and we're getting married."}, {"start": 716.72, "end": 723.96, "text": "I wonder what happened on all those other timelines."}, {"start": 723.96, "end": 728.36, "text": "Wait, there are other timelines?"}, {"start": 728.36, "end": 733.76, "text": "Okay, starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 733.76, "end": 736.04, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 736.04, "end": 740.72, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 740.72, "end": 742.68, "text": "One, Troy."}, {"start": 742.68, "end": 746.68, "text": "Damn it. I'm gonna go as fast as I can so I don't miss anything."}, {"start": 749.68, "end": 752.68, "text": "You know who I used to call miss anything? Eartha Kitt."}, {"start": 753.68, "end": 755.68, "text": "He totally set me up."}, {"start": 755.68, "end": 757.68, "text": "I'm checking on my pies."}, {"start": 757.68, "end": 758.68, "text": "Raaast!"}, {"start": 758.68, "end": 759.68, "text": "No!"}, {"start": 760.68, "end": 761.68, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 761.68, "end": 762.68, "text": "Yeah, over here."}, {"start": 763.68, "end": 766.68, "text": "Jeff, tell us about your father. I'm gonna get a drink."}, {"start": 767.68, "end": 768.68, "text": "Oh my god! Are you okay?"}, {"start": 768.68, "end": 769.68, "text": "I barely felt it."}, {"start": 769.68, "end": 771.68, "text": "Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 772.68, "end": 774.84, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 777.08, "end": 779.24, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 780.24, "end": 781.58, "text": "- What the hell?"}, {"start": 781.58, "end": 783.76, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 785.76, "end": 787.16, "text": "- Call 911!"}, {"start": 787.16, "end": 789.46, "text": "Orman, help me stop the bleeding!"}, {"start": 789.46, "end": 791.86, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 791.86, "end": 793.46, "text": "- I'm dying!"}, {"start": 793.46, "end": 794.36, "text": "I am dying!"}, {"start": 797.4, "end": 798.96, "text": "(screams)"}, {"start": 798.96, "end": 799.8, "text": "- Water."}, {"start": 800.7, "end": 801.6, "text": "Water!"}, {"start": 801.6, "end": 802.6, "text": "Louder!"}, {"start": 802.6, "end": 803.6, "text": "Louder!"}, {"start": 803.6, "end": 804.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 804.6, "end": 805.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 805.6, "end": 806.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 806.6, "end": 807.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 807.6, "end": 808.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 808.6, "end": 809.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 809.6, "end": 810.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 810.6, "end": 811.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 811.6, "end": 812.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 812.6, "end": 813.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 813.6, "end": 814.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 814.6, "end": 815.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 815.6, "end": 816.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 816.6, "end": 817.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 817.6, "end": 818.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 818.6, "end": 819.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 819.6, "end": 820.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 820.6, "end": 821.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 821.6, "end": 822.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 822.6, "end": 823.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 823.6, "end": 824.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 824.6, "end": 825.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 825.6, "end": 826.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 826.6, "end": 827.6, "text": "Breathe!"}, {"start": 827.6, "end": 828.6, "text": "Ah, okay."}, {"start": 828.6, "end": 829.6, "text": "Starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 829.6, "end": 830.6, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 830.6, "end": 835.6, "text": "Five, one, two, three, four, five."}, {"start": 835.6, "end": 836.6, "text": "I'll bet."}, {"start": 836.6, "end": 837.6, "text": "I'm on it."}, {"start": 837.6, "end": 841.32, "text": "You know who else was on it?"}, {"start": 841.32, "end": 843.12, "text": "And do you know what it is?"}, {"start": 843.12, "end": 844.6, "text": "Everybody give me money."}, {"start": 844.6, "end": 849.2, "text": "Oh, that ass got really soft into your personality."}, {"start": 849.2, "end": 851.08, "text": "I banged her at the kid."}, {"start": 851.08, "end": 852.08, "text": "Russ!"}, {"start": 852.08, "end": 853.08, "text": "No."}, {"start": 853.08, "end": 854.08, "text": "Bathroom?"}, {"start": 854.08, "end": 855.08, "text": "Down the hall."}, {"start": 855.08, "end": 856.96, "text": "Down the hall."}, {"start": 859.96, "end": 861.96, "text": "You mean you drank it."}, {"start": 861.96, "end": 863.96, "text": "Ow! Oh, my God! Are you okay?"}, {"start": 863.96, "end": 865.96, "text": "- I barely felt it. - Let me look at it in the bathroom."}, {"start": 865.96, "end": 867.96, "text": "- Where is it in the bathroom? - Oh."}, {"start": 870.96, "end": 872.96, "text": "Oh, no! What happened?"}, {"start": 872.96, "end": 874.96, "text": "Minor head wound."}, {"start": 875.96, "end": 878.96, "text": "Oh, my God. What smells amazing?"}, {"start": 878.96, "end": 880.96, "text": "Oh! Someone wants pie!"}, {"start": 880.96, "end": 882.96, "text": "You ain't a good nurse."}, {"start": 882.96, "end": 885.2, "text": "(giggling)"}, {"start": 887.04, "end": 890.58, "text": "- Oh my God, they taste just like regular-sized pies."}, {"start": 890.58, "end": 891.9, "text": "- Oh, yay!"}, {"start": 891.9, "end": 893.28, "text": "- Happy housewarming."}, {"start": 893.28, "end": 895.82, "text": "- Oh, thanks, Pierce."}, {"start": 897.32, "end": 898.94, "text": "Hey, while we're alone, I just wanted to say"}, {"start": 898.94, "end": 900.32, "text": "thanks for letting me live with you."}, {"start": 900.32, "end": 902.06, "text": "- Sometimes I feel like making desserts"}, {"start": 902.06, "end": 904.46, "text": "is the only thing I'm good for in the group."}, {"start": 904.46, "end": 907.72, "text": "- But now it's time for me to try and make it on my own."}, {"start": 907.72, "end": 908.6, "text": "Just like you did."}, {"start": 909.62, "end": 911.16, "text": "- I can't help but worry about you, Annie."}, {"start": 911.16, "end": 912.26, "text": "- Yeah, I don't think you should open it."}, {"start": 912.26, "end": 914.06, "text": "- No, what, what are you talking about?"}, {"start": 914.06, "end": 915.54, "text": "- You're very important to me."}, {"start": 916.42, "end": 918.54, "text": "- Crap, I was not supposed to eat your stuff."}, {"start": 918.54, "end": 919.68, "text": "We all made an agreement."}, {"start": 919.68, "end": 922.1, "text": "Crap, I was not supposed to say that out loud."}, {"start": 922.1, "end": 923.62, "text": "Crap, okay, cards on the table."}, {"start": 923.62, "end": 925.12, "text": "I'm really high right now."}, {"start": 925.12, "end": 925.96, "text": "- Oh!"}, {"start": 927.22, "end": 928.06, "text": "- Seriously."}, {"start": 928.06, "end": 928.88, "text": "- Would you stop and give me--"}, {"start": 928.88, "end": 929.78, "text": "- No, I want to give you something else."}, {"start": 929.78, "end": 931.5, "text": "A water pig, a speedboat."}, {"start": 931.5, "end": 932.72, "text": "Two water pigs."}, {"start": 932.72, "end": 935.74, "text": "- I can't believe I'm feeding my pies to a drug addict."}, {"start": 935.74, "end": 936.7, "text": "- Drug addict?"}, {"start": 936.7, "end": 937.94, "text": "You're a pie pusher."}, {"start": 937.94, "end": 940.36, "text": "You push pies to get love."}, {"start": 940.36, "end": 941.46, "text": "- Give it, Pierce."}, {"start": 941.46, "end": 943.46, "text": "It feels fun"}, {"start": 944.26, "end": 950.02, "text": "Sorry, I just had a weird deja vu bad at gift-giving that thing"}, {"start": 950.02, "end": 956.7, "text": "You said about worrying about me something my dad always said I demand to be housewarm. I should have brought it up"}, {"start": 957.66, "end": 959.66, "text": "Just reminded me of my dad"}, {"start": 960.0, "end": 966.42, "text": "Anyway, little make out 101 less dad talk and you could ease up on the bubble gum lip gloss"}, {"start": 971.46, "end": 975.66, "text": "-Pizza time! Give me this, you godless hippie scape!"}, {"start": 975.66, "end": 978.16, "text": "-You're a sick, sad, twisted old man,"}, {"start": 978.16, "end": 980.24, "text": "and I hope you die alone."}, {"start": 980.24, "end": 981.6, "text": "-Yeah."}, {"start": 981.6, "end": 983.34, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 983.34, "end": 986.38, "text": "I wonder what happened in all those other timelines."}, {"start": 986.38, "end": 990.64, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 990.64, "end": 991.98, "text": "I got to say, I hope this is the real one"}, {"start": 991.98, "end": 994.62, "text": "because I just found a nickel in the hallway."}, {"start": 994.62, "end": 997.76, "text": "♪♪♪♪"}, {"start": 997.76, "end": 999.16, "text": "[ Buzzer ]"}, {"start": 999.16, "end": 1000.26, "text": "-Ah, okay."}, {"start": 1000.26, "end": 1004.26, "text": "Okay, starting on my left with one, your number comes up, you go."}, {"start": 1004.26, "end": 1006.26, "text": "Just so you know, Jeff, you are now creating six different timelines."}, {"start": 1006.26, "end": 1008.26, "text": "Of course I am, Abed."}, {"start": 1013.26, "end": 1014.26, "text": "I don't think you should."}, {"start": 1016.26, "end": 1018.26, "text": "Chaos already dominates enough of our lives."}, {"start": 1018.26, "end": 1020.26, "text": "The universe is an endless, raging sea of randomness."}, {"start": 1020.26, "end": 1024.26, "text": "Our job isn't to fight it, but to weather it together on the raft of life."}, {"start": 1024.26, "end": 1028.26, "text": "A raft held together by those few, rare, beautiful things that we know to be predictable."}, {"start": 1028.26, "end": 1030.74, "text": "-Ropes? Vines. -Vines?"}, {"start": 1030.74, "end": 1034.04, "text": "-Let him finish. -Us."}, {"start": 1034.04, "end": 1035.8, "text": "It won't matter what happens to us as long as we stay honest"}, {"start": 1035.8, "end": 1038.28, "text": "in accepting of each other's flaws and virtues."}, {"start": 1038.28, "end": 1040.68, "text": "Annie will always be driven. Shirley will always be giving."}, {"start": 1040.68, "end": 1041.92, "text": "Pierce will never apologize."}, {"start": 1041.92, "end": 1043.54, "text": "Britt is sort of a wild card from my perspective."}, {"start": 1043.54, "end": 1046.38, "text": "And Jeff will forever remain a conniving son of a bitch."}, {"start": 1046.38, "end": 1048.42, "text": "-I'm a bitch. -There are six sides to this die"}, {"start": 1048.42, "end": 1049.86, "text": "and seven of us."}, {"start": 1049.86, "end": 1052.12, "text": "He devised a system by which he never has to give the pizza."}, {"start": 1052.12, "end": 1053.46, "text": "-Jack! -Really?"}, {"start": 1053.46, "end": 1055.6, "text": "-Crafty jackrabbit. -Dag, man."}, {"start": 1055.6, "end": 1059.6, "text": "It's called friendship. Look it up and car to it."}, {"start": 1059.6, "end": 1062.6, "text": "-I think we just found our pizza getter. -Yeah."}, {"start": 1062.6, "end": 1064.6, "text": "-Yes, we did. -Yes, we did."}, {"start": 1064.6, "end": 1067.6, "text": "-Oh, like, it matters who goes."}, {"start": 1067.6, "end": 1068.6, "text": "[ Laughter ]"}, {"start": 1068.6, "end": 1071.6, "text": "-That's so funny. -Karma."}, {"start": 1071.6, "end": 1075.6, "text": "-That guy sucks harder than the toilet in an airplane bathroom."}, {"start": 1075.6, "end": 1078.6, "text": "-Airplane bathroom. -Oh, my pies."}, {"start": 1078.6, "end": 1080.6, "text": "-Roxanne! -Roxanne!"}, {"start": 1080.6, "end": 1081.6, "text": "-Oh!"}, {"start": 1081.6, "end": 1086.6, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1087.34, "end": 1090.54, "text": "♪ Those days are over ♪"}, {"start": 1090.54, "end": 1093.76, "text": "♪ You don't have to sell your money to the night ♪"}, {"start": 1093.76, "end": 1094.6, "text": "♪ Sing, girls ♪"}, {"start": 1094.6, "end": 1095.92, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1095.92, "end": 1097.4, "text": "- I really love your plays."}, {"start": 1097.4, "end": 1098.24, "text": "- You should move here."}, {"start": 1098.24, "end": 1103.08, "text": "♪ You don't have to wear that dress tonight ♪"}, {"start": 1103.08, "end": 1105.04, "text": "♪ Walk the streets for money ♪"}, {"start": 1105.04, "end": 1105.88, "text": "- Come on, Charles."}, {"start": 1105.88, "end": 1109.1, "text": "♪ You don't care if it's wrong or if it's right ♪"}, {"start": 1109.1, "end": 1112.44, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1112.44, "end": 1116.12, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1116.12, "end": 1119.62, "text": "- You gotta see what happens when I leave you alone, huh?"}, {"start": 1119.62, "end": 1123.36, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1123.36, "end": 1124.28, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1124.28, "end": 1126.92, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1126.92, "end": 1127.76, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1127.76, "end": 1129.5, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1129.5, "end": 1130.42, "text": "- Don't try."}, {"start": 1130.42, "end": 1131.26, "text": "♪ Roxanne ♪"}, {"start": 1131.26, "end": 1133.76, "text": "♪ Put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1133.76, "end": 1138.5, "text": "♪ You don't have to put on the red light ♪"}, {"start": 1139.1, "end": 1142.02, "text": "To Pierce may he rest in Pierce"}, {"start": 1144.42, "end": 1147.18, "text": "Surely don't you think you've had enough of you"}, {"start": 1148.38, "end": 1151.46, "text": "Guys, I've been thinking about that night over and over one thing has become clear"}, {"start": 1151.58, "end": 1156.22, "text": "This is the darkest most terrible timeline enough with the timeline crap Abed"}, {"start": 1156.44, "end": 1163.58, "text": "Pierce got shot in the leg and died Shirley's a drunk and he's locked in a mental ward because her guilt drove her insane"}, {"start": 1163.82, "end": 1166.02, "text": "Jeff lost an arm in the fire."}, {"start": 1166.06, "end": 1169.46, "text": "Troy lost his larynx because for some dumb reason"}, {"start": 1169.5, "end": 1172.66, "text": "he tried to destroy a flaming troll doll by eating it."}, {"start": 1172.7, "end": 1175.54, "text": "Clearly, you don't understand anything about defeating trolls."}, {"start": 1175.58, "end": 1178.7, "text": "Life has gone to hell, Abed."}, {"start": 1178.74, "end": 1181.62, "text": "This is real. Look at us. Look at me."}, {"start": 1181.66, "end": 1184.86, "text": "Britta, you put one wash-away blue streak in your hair,"}, {"start": 1184.9, "end": 1186.7, "text": "and I lost an arm."}, {"start": 1186.74, "end": 1188.86, "text": "Exactly. Life got dark."}, {"start": 1188.9, "end": 1190.06, "text": "All because Jeff rolled a one."}, {"start": 1190.1, "end": 1192.3, "text": "Oh, I love how this is my fault somehow."}, {"start": 1192.34, "end": 1196.1, "text": "It's mine. I've run through that night over and over in my head and I keep coming back to one thought"}, {"start": 1196.1, "end": 1198.26, "text": "I should have caught the dye and not let you roll it. I"}, {"start": 1198.82, "end": 1201.96, "text": "Failed to do that and we all suffered for it, but I'm gonna make it up to you"}, {"start": 1204.62, "end": 1209.34, "text": "What is this of all the timelines this is clearly the darkest which is why I propose we commit to being evil"}, {"start": 1209.34, "end": 1212.58, "text": "I've made us all black go tease out of felt I suggest you put them on until you're able to grow your own"}, {"start": 1214.7, "end": 1216.7, "text": "From now on I'm evil Abed"}, {"start": 1216.94, "end": 1219.42, "text": "We are the evil study group and we have but one evil goal"}, {"start": 1220.22, "end": 1223.44, "text": "Return somehow to the prime timeline the one that I stopped you from rolling that die"}, {"start": 1223.48, "end": 1226.32, "text": "Then we destroy the good versions of ourselves and reclaim our proper lives"}, {"start": 1228.2, "end": 1234.3, "text": "Evil I bet as evil Jeff am I allowed to pull fewer punches with you? Certainly. I hate you"}, {"start": 1234.64, "end": 1240.24, "text": "Shut up with your sci-fi crap. I lost my damn arm and you're making fake beards"}, {"start": 1240.64, "end": 1242.64, "text": "Go tease"}, {"start": 1250.22, "end": 1253.12, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 1253.12, "end": 1255.96, "text": "♪ Evil Troy and evil Abed ♪"}, {"start": 1255.96, "end": 1257.16, "text": "[ Claps ]"}, {"start": 1257.16, "end": 1260.86, "text": "♪♪"}, {"start": 1260.86, "end": 1263.16, "text": "[ Man speaking indistinctly ]"}, {"start": 1263.16, "end": 1265.5, "text": "What's wrong?"}, {"start": 1265.5, "end": 1268.2, "text": "I don't know."}, {"start": 1268.2, "end": 1270.9, "text": "[ Man speaking indistinctly ]"}, {"start": 1270.9, "end": 1272.5, "text": "I guess nothing."}, {"start": 1280.22, "end": 1285.22, "text": "♪ ♪ ♪"}]}